          "_key": "r6b45y4qzblt",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "This End User License Agreement (\u201cAgreement\u201d) is a legal agreement between you (either an individual or a single entity) and Dashbud (a general partnership of Arthur Dobelis and Scott Binger) (\"Provider\") for the use of the Dashbud software platform and any associated services, documentation, and updates (\"Dashbud\")."
