        {
          "_key": "ht64bt10g8s3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "3. User Data and Privacy"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nj5e8saiiryv",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "gl0lvrah88vf",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Data Ownership: You retain all rights to the data you upload or connect to Dashbud."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nfwevngt8gg0",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "yu4xq9f6psv5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Privacy: Dashbud shares only metadata (table and column names, types, and relationships) with AI services by default. Instrumental context data such as taxonomies and category values may be shared with AI services only with your confirmation. Row-level data is never transmitted to AI services. Dashbud does not use your data to train, fine-tune, or develop AI models."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "397kv8fnzsr8",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "cvrowmtd54h5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Security: Provider uses commercially reasonable measures to secure your data, including encryption in transit and at rest, but you are responsible for safeguarding access credentials."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "cdto95fsobsc",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "njq96o7uc5yh",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "HIPAA: Customers requiring a Business Associate Agreement should contact Dashbud prior to connecting protected health information."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "qqsxll2zzuzf",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "pvrehvuz4o0d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "4. Service Levels and Availability"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "7r1khlkuucvg",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "wdy2yf7dy7z2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Dashbud is provided on an \u201cas is\u201d and \u201cas available\u201d basis. Provider will make commercially reasonable efforts to ensure uptime and support but does not guarantee uninterrupted service."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "1lghymd6o87q",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ezm9gcepj4xc",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "5. Fees and Payment"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "wwp347qtiyuy",
      "_type": "block",
